IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ALTERED.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-I PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-I.
TOP.
    IF WS-I >= 3
        GO TO DONE
    END-IF.
    ADD 1 TO WS-I.
    GO TO GATE.
GATE.
    GO TO PATH-1.
PATH-1.
    DISPLAY WS-I " first".
    ALTER GATE TO PROCEED TO PATH-2.
    GO TO TOP.
PATH-2.
    DISPLAY WS-I " again".
    GO TO TOP.
DONE.
    STOP RUN.
